- Row 18 — I assumed any NaN makes [38;5;10mc2RaytoAABB[0m reject. It doesn't. [38;5;10mc2RayToPlane_OneDimensional[0m only goes NaN when [38;5;10mda[0m is NaN, and [38;5;10mda[0m comes from [38;5;10mp0[0m alone. So NaN in [38;5;10mA.d[0m or [38;5;10mA.t[0m leaves all four [38;5;10mda[0m finite and the C [1maccepts[22m, writing [38;5;10m*out[0m. Only NaN in both axes of [38;5;10mA.p[0m rejects.[0m[0m
- Row 42 — I predicted [38;5;10mgen_ray[0m returns mask 6 for a zero-length ray. Measured: [38;5;10m{0, 2, 4, 6}[0m all occur, with 4 dominating.[0m[0m
